---
globs: "**/*.ts, **/*.tsx, **/*.js, **/*.jsx"
alwaysApply: false
---

- Comment only complex logic, workarounds, performance tradeoffs, and non-obvious dependencies.
- Do not comment trivial loops or "this fixes issue #N" (use the commit message).
- Public functions use JSDoc (`@param`, `@returns`, `@throws`). TODOs include issue, owner, and status. Examples: @AGENTS.md
